00:05:56,666 --> 00:06:02,666
It's 1975 and they're about to explode.

2
00:11:53,333 --> 00:11:59,333
The Runaways is a music, drama, history film directed by Floria Sigismondi.

3
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:56,000
Joan Jett and Cherie Currie, two rebellious teenagers from Southern California, become the frontwomen for The
Runaways -- the now-legendary group that paved the way for future generations of female rockers.

4
00:23:46,666 --> 00:23:52,666
Under the Svengali-like influence of impresario Kim
Fowley, the band becomes a huge success.

5
00:29:43,333 --> 00:29:49,333
Joan Jett, played by Kristen Stewart.

6
00:35:40,000 --> 00:35:46,000
Cherie Currie, played by Dakota Fanning.

7
00:41:36,666 --> 00:41:42,666
Kim Fowley, played by Michael Shannon.

8
00:47:33,333 --> 00:47:39,333
Sandy West, played by Stella Maeve.

9
00:53:30,000 --> 00:53:36,000
Lita Ford, played by Scout Taylor-Compton.

10
00:59:26,666 --> 00:59:32,666
Robin, played by Alia Shawkat.

11
01:05:23,333 --> 01:05:29,333
The Runaways is a 2010 American biographical drama film about the 1970s rock band of the same name
written and directed by Floria Sigismondi in her screenwriting and feature directional debut.

12
01:11:20,000 --> 01:11:26,000
It is based on the book Neon Angel: A Memoir of a Runaway
by the band's lead vocalist Cherie Currie.

13
01:17:16,666 --> 01:17:22,666
The film stars Dakota Fanning as Currie, Kristen Stewart as rhythm guitarist and
vocalist Joan Jett, and Michael Shannon as record producer Kim Fowley.

14
01:23:13,333 --> 01:23:19,333
The Runaways depicts the formation of the band in 1975 and focuses on the
relationship between Currie and Jett until Currie's departure from the band.

15
01:29:10,000 --> 01:29:16,000
The film grossed around $4.6 million worldwide and received
generally favorable reviews from critics.

16
01:35:06,666 --> 01:35:12,666
The film explores themes of iron, 1970s, publicity, nightclub, pill.

17
01:41:03,333 --> 01:41:09,333
The tone is emotional.
